54
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:40,336
¿Por qué? Sabes, esto me hace rudo.

55
00:09:40,419 --> 00:09:42,296
- Pareces un poco rudo.
- Rudo.

56
00:09:43,089 --> 00:09:44,131
Rudo.

57
00:09:48,552 --> 00:09:50,304
