- No, está bien.

144
00:20:18,891 --> 00:20:20,184
Hará menos alboroto.

145
00:20:20,976 --> 00:20:23,396
- Seguro.
- Vamos, pequeña apestosa.

146
00:20:26,941 --> 00:20:28,693
Vamos a cambiarte.

147
00:20:31,237 --> 00:20:32,488
Eso es.

148
00:20:33,739 --> 00:20:35,700
Hola.

149
00:20:37,785 --> 00:20:39,662
Hola, Rosie.

150
00:20:47,837 --> 00:20:48,838
Kay.

151
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:56,512
Ven, Rosie.

152
00:21:00,891 --> 00:21:02,977
