158
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:16,926
¡Dios mío!

159
00:22:21,597 --> 00:22:22,682
Kay.

160
00:22:23,557 --> 00:22:24,600
Kay.

161
00:22:24,684 --> 00:22:26,310
Oye, escúchame. Sólo ven...

162
00:22:26,394 --> 00:22:27,728
¡No me toques!

163
00:22:28,521 --> 00:22:30,690
Andy, no puedes controlar esto.

164
00:22:31,482 --> 00:22:33,734
