192
00:25:39,420 --> 00:25:40,629
Kay.

193
00:26:17,792 --> 00:26:18,959
Oye.

194
00:26:25,007 --> 00:26:29,178
SÁLVALA

195
00:26:30,179 --> 00:26:32,098
